gbcC(){return"The following personal data is processed:\n\n\u2022 Email address \u2014 provided at account registration.\n\u2022 Portfolio data \u2014 stock holdings and transactions, manually entered by the user.\n\u2022 Journal entries \u2014 trading notes and reflections, manually entered by the user.\n\u2022 Goals \u2014 financial goals, manually entered by the user.\n\u2022 Authentication tokens \u2014 generated upon login, stored in device secure local storage.\n\u2022 Billing and subscription status \u2014 processed by the applicable app store platform (Apple App Store or Google Play). The developer does not receive or store full payment card details.\n\u2022 Crash diagnostic data \u2014 when an unhandled error occurs, the error message, stack trace, device type, OS version, and app version are transmitted to Sentry for debugging purposes. No portfolio data, financial figures, or user-identifiable information is included in these reports.\n\nNo advertising identifiers, location data, or device tracking data are collected. The developer does not engage in any form of user behaviour tracking."},
